    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "retrieve-as-tool",
        "toolDescription": "Use this tool to answer any customer question about Lumora Home. Search it for:\n\nPRODUCTS: Sofas, accent chairs, benches, coffee tables, side tables, floor lamps, pendant lights, wall sconces, cookware sets, cast iron skillets, Dutch ovens, dinnerware, mugs, serving boards, kitchen textiles, duvet inserts, sheet sets, throw blankets, pillowcases, bath towels, robes, bath mats, soap dispensers, and bathroom shelves. Include SKUs, prices, dimensions, materials, and compatibility details.\n\nSHIPPING: Domestic rates (free over $75), expedited, overnight, White-Glove delivery for furniture, Canada and UK international shipping, processing times, tracking, and order delays.\n\nRETURNS & REFUNDS: 30-day return window, eligibility by category (furniture, lighting, cookware, bedding, bath), how to start a return, refund timelines, damaged or incorrect item procedures, international return rules.\n\nPAYMENTS: Accepted methods (Visa, Mastercard, Amex, PayPal, Apple Pay, Google Pay, Shop Pay), Shop Pay Installments via Affirm, gift cards, promo code rules, and payment security.\n\nPRODUCT CARE: Cleaning and maintenance instructions for upholstery, leather, wood, marble, cookware, and all textiles.\n\nLUMORA REWARDS: Point earning actions, redemption tiers (500–5,000 points), Moss/Stone/Oak membership tiers, birthday bonuses, referral points, and expiry rules.\n\nGENERAL: Warranty policy (1-year), fabric samples, sustainable sourcing, account management, password reset, and contact details.\n\nAlways retrieve from this tool before answering. Do not answer from memory.",
